{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b63271848172112ae327e3954ae6f2b13bfcc552e5b53c43f63260e677df69c9","ja":"Aが高級ワインですわ！\n間違いありません！","zh":"A才是高级葡萄酒！\n绝对不会有错！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fb9a0dee3051dd88b814d445cb404ee7906ce196b1340345294857c364232a43","ja":"「なるほど、自信満々ですね。\nそれでは正解は…………Aです、おめでとう！！」","zh":"“原来如此，胸有成竹呢。\n那么正确答案是…………A，恭喜你！！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0ec5ca83913fd8367a28e55be9059cb97386c0ce7af5533e1805a6c1cf8a90ca","ja":"ワアアアアアアッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4b9c45272d51ddcf607a3950680e963a66388888da3ad368028ee9508b6d0a7a","ja":"千鶴ちゃん、優勝おめでとう！　最後の問題なんて、\n思わずテレビの前で拍手しちゃったわ♪","zh":"千鹤，祝贺你获胜！最后那道题，\n我不由得在电视机前为你鼓掌了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"62d5d91a8ee03bd429d32c94e905f887be01b1288f96843b886a3d81cd22c3eb","ja":"ふふ、あずさがワイナリーに誘っていただいた\nおかげですわ！　ありがとうございました！","zh":"呵呵，多亏了梓邀请我前往酒庄！\n真是太感谢了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"168823858ade00bda68d78086cba65e4865b1f106111e85255aea03a21941a54","ja":"どういたしまして。私もワインの試飲や勉強ができて\nとっても楽しかったわ♪","zh":"不用客气。我也能品尝红酒、学习知识，\n玩得非常开心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"dd99e523366c803c2fbd6100ff16a818496a294fefe097dc3cd8386b94e1a6d1","ja":"なんだか前よりワインのことが好きになったかも？\nうふふ、このワインもいつか飲んでみたいわ～♪","zh":"感觉比以前更喜欢葡萄酒了呢？\n呵呵，我也想什么时候尝尝这款葡萄酒呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0a20a809f4c9404b755799b0a22495d2cd33812980857a8f4b20e4853501bece","ja":"それは……ワインの本ですわね。\nどのようなものが載っているのかしら……？","zh":"那是……葡萄酒的书呢。\n上面都写了些什么样的内容呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d5b71097544930bffa5382b5bb604c7b5ef0494390bd6e68ae73e2a4ad06179e","ja":"（今回のお礼に、あずさにワインを贈るのも\nいいかもしれませんわね。さっそく買って……）","zh":"（送瓶葡萄酒给梓作为这次的谢礼\n好像也挺不错的呢。这就去买……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15","ja":"ええっ！？","zh":"诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ed0d575e7ac84fffeca42ab2a22e436830730035118a0d3cbcdc3fe977b7fba4","ja":"えっ！？　ど、どうしたの？　千鶴ちゃん……？","zh":"诶！？怎、怎么了吗？千鹤……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"db1559e9756c0baff2dfbde124e902ccaaa3311b8e35a7e8bc2bcfec17376804","ja":"い、いえっ……な、なんでもありませんわ！\nおほほほほ……。","zh":"没、没什么……什、什么事都没有哦！\n哦吼吼吼吼……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d91937e7b03481e80e4c375982e81c1af2242df3332dd3f9a3617a15d0ddee81","ja":"（あずさの見ているワイン……高級すぎますわっ！\nこちらはちょっと……）","zh":"（梓在看的那款红酒……实在太高档了！\n这个价格有点……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1271.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c05e3da9c888c213bb8814e3cea5a1abb98e6157ea9dfadadf0531ea9be4ad64","ja":"（べ、別の贈り物を考えましょう！　感謝の気持ちは\n……そう！　お値段以外でも表せますもの！）","zh":"（换、换个别的礼物想想吧！感谢的心情\n……对！也不是只有靠价格才能表达的嘛！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
